The bug was caused by allowing sockets that were not in the ESTABLISHED state to be added to the sockmap, which could lead to unexpected behavior or errors in the socket management. The patch ensures that only sockets in the ESTABLISHED state are accepted, preventing potential issues related to socket state management.
